This taxonomy covers 250+ distinct platforms and resource categories that can be targeted with X-Ray search. In practice, experienced technical recruiters often prioritize:

GitHub (developers, open-source work)
Stack Overflow / Stack Exchange (technical expertise)
Personal portfolio sites (Netlify, Vercel, GitHub Pages)
Conference speaker and attendee pages
University faculty, research, and student project pages
Public PDF/DOC resumes
Hugging Face, Kaggle, and Papers With Code (AI/ML talent)
Behance and Dribbble (design talent)

These sources generally provide richer publicly indexed information than traditional professional networking profiles today.

